# Vehicles

All `.glb` files in this folder except where noted come from **munim-maps-vehicles** 0.5.0
(github.com/munimtechnologies/munim-maps, `packages/munim-maps-vehicles`), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 — see `LICENSE-munim-maps-vehicles.txt`. The models are generated from code and
carry no logos or brand names. Changes: geometry compressed for the web (meshopt + quantisation);
body colours are repainted at runtime.

The concept car used in town traffic is `../nature/car.glb` (Khronos glTF Sample Assets, CC BY 4.0);
see `../nature/NOTICE.md`.
